OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAreas of dense fog will be slow
OL,6,Fto clear on Monday, but some sunny
OL,7,Fspells developing. Any lingering
OL,8,Fshowers in Kent and Sussex soon
OL,9,Ffading. Feeling cool, especially where
OL,10,Ffog lingers. Breezy later.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA dry evening is expected
OL,13,Fwith clear spells, but breezy. Cloud
OL,14,Fthickening, with rain into
OL,15,Fsouthwestern parts during the early
OL,16,Fhours.
OL,17,
OL,18,CTuesday:FMostly cloudy start, with
OL,19,Frain in the southwest slowly moving
OL,20,Facross all areas. Rain may be
OL,21,Foccasionally heavy. Breezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
