OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FA wet
OL,6,Fand breezy start Wednesday, turning
OL,7,Fdry later. Mostly dry with sunny
OL,8,Fspells Thursday and Friday, isolated
OL,9,Fshowers on Thursday. Temperatures
OL,10,Fturning cooler.
